---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About MotorByte | For the Love of Cars"
  description="MotorByte is a place for people who love cars, from everyday drivers and modern performance machines to the classics that stay with us."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-400">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">A place for people who love cars.</h1>
    <div class="prose-post mt-8">
      <p>MotorByte is all about cars: the machines that make an ordinary drive special, the engineering behind them, and the memories and communities they bring together.</p>
      <p>Here you’ll find stories about classic cars, modern performance, and the details that make a car worth talking about. Whether you’re a lifelong enthusiast or simply curious, you’re welcome here.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
